[COMMAND]:      install.set.gitkey
[PACKAGE]:      INSTALL
[USE]:          dock -install set.gitkey

[OUT]:          Set the correct permissions to the GIT key on the local computer.

[ACTIONS]:      chmod 600 /mnt/Dock/Scripts/Keys/gitkey_rsa
                chmod 644 /mnt/Dock/Scripts/Keys/gitkey_rsa.pub

[NOTES]:        N/A
